  "title": "Reg CC Funds-Availability Calculator",
  "description": "Reference table of the Regulation CC (12 CFR 229) dollar thresholds frozen to their 2030 inflation-adjusted values, plus hold-schedule date math: given a deposit date and deposit type, computes the funds-availability date using configurable business-day counts. Reference figures and day-counts must be re-verified against the current Federal Register notice and 12 CFR 229 Subpart B before compliance use.",
  "category": "cat-2",
  "tags": [
